  faqs: { en: [
    { q: "How do I change the default order size on the Tradovate DOM?", a: "Set the number in the Qty field at the top of the SuperDOM. That value holds as your working size for that ladder until you change it. For a size that persists across sessions, check the module Settings (gear icon) and confirm the exact label in your build." },
    { q: "Why can't I change the quantity of an order I already placed?", a: "Tradovate doesn't allow editing the contract count on a working order. You can move its price, but to change size you have to cancel and re-place it at the new quantity, or add a separate order to scale in." },
